  the short scan assumed period 1/v.  That is the period of the FULL-GROUP
  average -- t -> t + 1/v permutes {k/v : k mod v}.  It is NOT a period of the
  reduced-residue average, because t -> t + 1/v carries r/v to (r+1)/v and the
  units are not closed under +1.  The symmetry used to shrink the search
  belonged to a different object.

