====================================================================================
3.  so the trichotomy is a DICHOTOMY, and it is prop:twopower again
====================================================================================
  the evaluation of prop:redresidue is a BOUND on the surrounding arc
  if and only if v is a power of two -- i.e. exactly when the reduced
  residues form a coset.  For every other v the average falls under a shift.
